### ====================================================================
### RepoRadar Server REST API - Test Requests (Module 1)
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension, Postman, or curl
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@projectId = 65d75cf9e1d84f23b890abcd

### 1. Server Root Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create Project - Success
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RepoRadar Core Engine",
  "description": "AI-powered AST static analysis and vulnerability scanning pipeline"
}

### 4. Create Project 2 (Additional test project)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Next.js Web Client",
  "description": "Interactive dark-mode radar dashboard and telemetry frontend"
}

### 5. List All Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Project By ID
# Replace with an actual ID returned from the createProject request above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Update Project - Success (Update name and description)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RepoRadar Core Engine (Updated v1.1)",
  "description": "Updated description with enhanced multi-language AST support"
}

### 8. Update Project - Partial (Update description only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description only"
}

### 9. Delete Project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### Validation & Error Handling Test Cases
### ====================================================================

### 10. Validation Error: Create Project with missing name (Expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Project without a name"
}

### 11. Validation Error: Invalid MongoDB ObjectId in URL (Expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/invalid-mongo-id-123
Accept: application/json

### 12. Validation Error: Update Project with empty body (Expect 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/65d75cf9e1d84f23b890abcd
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 13. Not Found Error: Get Non-Existent Project (Expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/65d75cf9e1d84f23b890abce
Accept: application/json

### 14. 404 Error: Non-Existent Route (Expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unknown-endpoint
Accept: application/json
